[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Extrude To Next (GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#674): up to the first face of the bodies ahead of the profile, found without a pick. A low block (Extrude1 F2, x 0..30, z 0..10) and a plate beside it that nothing holds up (Extrude2 F4, x 30..60, z 20..25)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 30, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F3", "corner": [30, 0], "width": 30, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 20},
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 5}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 6000, "min": [30, 0, 20], "max": [60, 40, 25]}},

  {"comment": "Complete coverage: a 60 x 40 rectangle 40 mm up, down (Sketch3 F5, Extrude3 F6). Over the block it ends on the block's top (z = 10), over the plate on the plate's top (z = 25); under the plate the outside of the bodies joins the space above the block, which the extent parts along the bodies' outlines."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F5", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 40}, "flip": true,
    "extent": {"type": "to_next"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude3", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F6.b0", "volume": 54000, "min": [0, 0, 10], "max": [60, 40, 40]}},

  {"comment": "The block made 15 mm high: the extrusion follows it."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F2", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 15}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude3", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F6.b0", "volume": 48000, "min": [0, 0, 15], "max": [60, 40, 40]}},

  {"comment": "Upwards from there no body lies ahead: To Next does not turn round."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F6", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 40},
    "extent": {"type": "to_next"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude3", "status": "error", "error_contains": "To Next finds no body ahead of the profile"}},

  {"comment": "Partial coverage: an 80 x 40 rectangle, down (Sketch4 F7, Extrude4 F8): its part beyond x = 60 meets no face."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F7", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 80, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F7", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 40}, "flip": true,
    "extent": {"type": "to_next"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude4", "status": "error", "error_contains": "To Next finds no face ahead of a part of the profile"}},

  {"comment": "A Join from the block's top up to the plate's underside: a 10 mm circle under the plate 15 mm up (Sketch5 F9, Extrude5 F10). The block, behind the start, is no target; the post joins the plate."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F9", "center": [45, 20], "diameter": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F9", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 15},
    "extent": {"type": "to_next"}, "operation": "join"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude5", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 6392.699, "min": [30, 0, 15], "max": [60, 40, 25]}}
]
